stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: Valid create / reserve lot or identified creature once
    Active --> Sold: Valid funded purchase wins transaction
    Active --> Cancelled: Seller cancellation wins transaction
    Active --> Expired: Expiry worker wins transaction
    Sold --> Sold: Duplicate purchase operation / prior result only
    Cancelled --> Cancelled: Duplicate cancel operation / prior result only
    Expired --> Expired: Repeated expiry scan / no second return
    note right of Active
      Concurrent buy, cancel and expiry have one winner.
      A new purchase against a closed listing is rejected.
    end note
    note right of Sold
      Buyer asset and seller net proceeds are durable.
      Cancel / expiry returns the same reserved asset once.
      Creature prices are bounded by species and Quality Rank.
    end note
